The first focused proof exposed a genuine base-case issue in the summary definition: an abstract nonempty pattern did not constructor-match the nonempty-pattern equation, even though the invariant’s guard excluded emptiness. I’m repairing the definition to partition on the explicit empty/nonempty guard, which is both exhaustive and disjoint and lets the base obligation reduce without adding any execution shortcut.
